WEBVTT

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:35.540
Mistake?

00:01:36.210 --> 00:01:38.700
What do you mean, mistake?

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:40.500
Not only did they screw 
up multiple times,

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:41.700
the report we got was 
utterly false, as well.

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:43.960
And thanks to that, the 
princess was basically

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:46.500
able to saunter into the capital!

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:51.700
Damn that Erecpyle, his title 
of best swordsman is weeping.

00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:55.170
This will give the moderates a 
second wind, that's for sure.

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:57.800
Someone must take 
responsibility for this.

00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:00.490
I'd even go so far as 
to question if Incognito

00:02:00.490 --> 00:02:02.680
needs to exist any longer.

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:05.360
But if you get rid of 
them, can you guarantee

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:07.560
capable men to take their place?

00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:11.580
Are you suggesting that you will 
take responsibility instead?

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:13.070
I only...

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:17.570
Enough already!

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:20.680
We've got more important 
things to do

00:02:20.680 --> 00:02:22.570
than sitting around and pointing fingers.

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:25.330
Your Excellency... But...

00:02:25.600 --> 00:02:28.430
To realize the world we wish for.

00:02:28.430 --> 00:02:31.050
That is our ultimate goal.

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:35.990
You should all just quietly 
work towards that goal.

00:02:36.390 --> 00:02:38.540
Your Excellency, that is precisely why

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:42.050
intervention will become even 
more necessary on all fronts.

00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:45.900
With the current undercover 
operations' plans, we're simply

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:47.150
stretched too thin.

00:02:47.570 --> 00:02:48.850
That I understand.

00:02:49.670 --> 00:02:52.550
Our preparations are already complete.

00:02:56.080 --> 00:02:58.820
Men, DT lives.

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:03.660
Unfortunately, it looks like 
he has outwitted us yet again.

00:03:04.420 --> 00:03:10.110
Yes, we've made a mistake, 
but we can still rectify it!

00:03:10.550 --> 00:03:13.670
In fact, rectifying it is our mission.

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:17.130
Right now, we have intelligence that 
they are in the empire's capital.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:18.670
We will begin moving immediately.

00:03:20.230 --> 00:03:21.830
Incognito, dispa—

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:23.250
Please wait, Erec-sama.

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:26.180
I've got urgent orders 
from headquarters.

00:03:26.990 --> 00:03:28.180
What?

00:03:43.940 --> 00:03:45.340
Is something wrong?

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:47.950
Not really, it's just that

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:51.220
I've had to think about a lot of things.

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:54.830
This is just what you needed, isn't it?

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:58.970
You just sit there and get 
to Jugglaburk in no time.

00:03:58.970 --> 00:04:02.530
Hey, old man, once this 
airship arrives...

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:05.210
Yeah, our journey together 
will be over, as well.

00:04:05.650 --> 00:04:06.720
I see.

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:10.460
And you're all right with that?

00:04:10.990 --> 00:04:12.340
What are you talking about?

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:13.860
I'm talking about the princess.

00:04:13.860 --> 00:04:15.340
Nabokov had a pretty decent face

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:17.730
and she'll be marrying into 
a rich house, but still...

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:20.480
That's nothing for us to 
involve ourselves in.

00:04:20.930 --> 00:04:22.690
You should know that.

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:23.610
Still.

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:28.620
Our duty is delivering the 
princess safely to Jugglaburk.

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:30.370
Do you really believe that?

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:35.580
Well, I guess in the end 
we're just servants.

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:39.440
Oh yeah, where is the princess, anyway?

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:42.380
The marriage ceremony has many 
rituals that go with it.

00:04:42.660 --> 00:04:45.850
Right now, Mariandel is 
teaching her those motions.

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:48.080
Marriage ceremony, huh?

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:51.550
Will she be okay, 
learning all that from her?

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:03.630
Now we're all done here.

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:06.180
I can't believe they really 
got on that thing.

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:08.920
Rich people...

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:24.940
<i>House arrest?</i>

00:05:24.940 --> 00:05:26.510
<i>What is the meaning of this?</i>

00:05:26.850 --> 00:05:28.410
<i>No, it's not house arrest.</i>

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:30.670
<i>It just says that he should not take any 
action without further instruction.</i>

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:33.750
<i>You idiot, that is exactly 
what house arrest is!</i>

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:36.610
<i>Are they trying to 
force you to resign?!</i>

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:37.790
<i>This isn't funny!</i>

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:39.520
<i>Do you think we'll let 
them get away with this?</i>

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:41.770
<i>Erec-sama, let's move out right now!</i>

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:42.920
<i>He's right.</i>

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:44.130
<i>The ends will justify the means...</i>

00:05:44.130 --> 00:05:45.940
<i>No. We will obey these orders.</i>

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:47.090
<i>Erec-sama!</i>

00:05:47.090 --> 00:05:49.780
<i>We're on standby until 
further notice. Dismissed.</i>

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:51.160
<i>Erec-sama!</i>

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:53.050
<i>Erec-sama!</i>

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:02.280
<i>Erec-sama is under house arrest.</i>

00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:05.760
<i>Incognito can't do anything officially.</i>

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:09.150
<i>But we can't just stand back 
and do nothing either.</i>

00:06:14.550 --> 00:06:17.780
<i>Which means the only
 thing we can do</i>

00:06:17.780 --> 00:06:20.440
<i>is take care of the root cause
 before the higher-ups take action.</i>

00:06:21.260 --> 00:06:23.850
<i>Don't take this personally, Princess.</i>

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:26.350
What's wrong, Princess?

00:06:26.810 --> 00:06:28.810
Nothing.

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:31.120
It doesn't look like nothing.

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:33.620
All's well that ends well.

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:35.880
Nabokov turned out to be 
prettier than we thought

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:38.130
and he's not that much 
older than you, either.

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:40.750
He doesn't have a big gut, either.

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:44.750
Don't worry.

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:47.260
It turned out all right in the end.

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:49.450
I was worried too, in the beginning,

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:51.560
but then it all turned 
out all right in the end.

00:06:51.560 --> 00:06:54.090
You know what they say. 
Worrying never does get you anywhere.

00:06:54.090 --> 00:06:57.300
Oh, but all that was applicable 
before we got to this point.

00:06:57.750 --> 00:07:00.320
But I'm sure you'll do just fine.

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:03.320
I am sure that it will 
all turn out fine in the end.

00:07:03.720 --> 00:07:06.160
Of course, it's not like I'll 
be the one giving birth...

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:07.360
Enough! Shut up!

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:09.350
I apologize. I just...

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:11.100
I swear.

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:12.530
Everyone is so...

00:07:25.910 --> 00:07:27.550
<i>What are you doing?!</i>

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:29.800
<i>At that age, and he's 
bouncing around on a bed</i>

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:31.540
<i>in nothing but a pair of underwear!</i>

00:07:31.540 --> 00:07:32.640
<i>How old is this guy?</i>

00:07:32.640 --> 00:07:33.430
<i>Is he a child?!</i>

00:07:37.090 --> 00:07:38.890
<i>He hit it, he hit his head!</i>

00:07:41.180 --> 00:07:43.270
<i>That hurts. Yup, that hurts.</i>

00:07:47.060 --> 00:07:49.280
<i>Now what is he going to do?</i>

00:07:52.810 --> 00:07:53.910
<i>What's this?</i>

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:07.420
<i>Wait, is it that? That 60 km/h,</i>

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:09.670
<i>that 60 km/h thing?!</i> {TL Note: supposedly the wind feels like boobs then >_>}

00:08:13.850 --> 00:08:17.050
<i>He looks happy. He looks really happy!</i>

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:22.180
<i>Now what is he going to do?</i>

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:27.310
<i>Idiot!</i>

00:08:29.890 --> 00:08:31.470
<i>I mean, what a moron!</i>

00:08:31.470 --> 00:08:33.000
<i>What the hell is he doing?</i>

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:34.340
<i>First that 60 km/h thing, and now</i>

00:08:34.340 --> 00:08:35.520
<i>he's sticking his ass out the window?</i>

00:08:35.520 --> 00:08:36.560
<i>What is he doing?</i>

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:38.080
<i>I really don't understand!</i>

00:08:39.380 --> 00:08:41.170
<i>Right is clear, left is clear.</i>

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:51.330
<i>No...</i>

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:58.670
Stop that!

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:08.860
Hey, um, sorry about that.

00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:12.000
Why didn't you tell me 
you were standing there?

00:09:13.930 --> 00:09:16.360
<i>That's not the problem here!</i>

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:18.570
So, how can I help you?

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:20.920
Yes! Well, you see...

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:24.820
Hey, so that Nabokov guy.

00:09:24.820 --> 00:09:25.710
What's he like?

00:09:26.130 --> 00:09:27.510
What do you mean by that?

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:30.950
Oh well, it's not like I'll 
be doing it or anything,

00:09:30.950 --> 00:09:32.930
so it doesn't really 
matter, but, you know?

00:09:32.930 --> 00:09:35.220
I mean, she is a little brat and she

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:37.450
always gets physical, 
and it's always a fist, mind you.

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:39.380
I don't think anyone else 
can piss me off as much as

00:09:39.380 --> 00:09:41.480
the little brat, 
always looking down on me.

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:44.040
You mean to say that you are 
worried about Ecarlate-sama.

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:46.730
I mean, it's not like 
we're complete strangers.

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:49.420
I figure she might as well be with 
someone who isn't totally horrible.

00:09:49.420 --> 00:09:50.910
Please lay your worries to rest.

00:09:50.910 --> 00:09:52.930
Lord Nabokov is a 
wonderfully upstanding man

00:09:52.930 --> 00:09:54.460
with a deep sense of humanity.

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:55.820
I see.

00:09:56.410 --> 00:09:58.490
<i>Like I've even met him.</i>

00:10:01.070 --> 00:10:03.120
You are against this?

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:05.070
Well, wouldn't you be?

00:10:05.070 --> 00:10:08.410
Don't tell me you'd just nod and 
agree to marry any old person

00:10:08.410 --> 00:10:10.640
they picked out for you, 
right after meeting them!

00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:12.590
Not to mention, she's just a kid!

00:10:12.820 --> 00:10:15.510
<i>Stop being so damn naïve.</i>

00:10:15.720 --> 00:10:16.300
Huh?

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:18.500
Excuse me?

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:20.600
I feel like I've met you before.

00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:22.160
I'm sure we haven't.

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:23.060
Are you really sure?

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:24.330
Entirely sure.

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:27.650
And yet I can't shake the 
feeling that I've definitely

00:10:27.650 --> 00:10:29.350
met you somewhere before.

00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:32.110
And not just once! Again and again!

00:10:32.410 --> 00:10:33.930
I'm sure I have.

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:35.620
I've seen that nose before.

00:10:36.680 --> 00:10:38.360
It's not the nose.

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:54.100
You caused a lot of 
trouble, but in the end,

00:10:54.100 --> 00:10:57.420
you went down quite easily, DT.

00:10:58.210 --> 00:11:01.830
<i>If they find the body, 
they'll know that I'm here.</i>

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:04.560
<i>I need to hurry.</i>

00:11:11.180 --> 00:11:12.320
Excuse me!

00:11:13.930 --> 00:11:14.800
Come in.

00:11:17.580 --> 00:11:20.530
Lord Nabokov, we've 
discovered an intruder.

00:11:20.920 --> 00:11:22.260
An intruder?

00:11:23.400 --> 00:11:24.580
Who is it?

00:11:24.900 --> 00:11:27.710
I'm not yet aware of the details, 
but he appears to be a pro.

00:11:28.090 --> 00:11:31.370
I'm afraid he is a member of Incognito.

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:34.080
The Ulga Sorority.

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:35.840
What shall we do?

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:37.840
Nothing.

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:38.460
I beg your pardon?

00:11:38.810 --> 00:11:41.910
I'm sure he is here to take 
my bride-to-be's life.

00:11:41.910 --> 00:11:44.810
If they find out that I impeded this,

00:11:44.810 --> 00:11:47.150
it will become a problem 
in its own right.

00:11:47.150 --> 00:11:49.850
Why don't we just sit back and observe?

00:11:50.490 --> 00:11:51.600
Are you certain?

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:54.060
Of course, I will be 
sorry to lose my bride.

00:11:54.550 --> 00:11:58.070
But I don't know how politics 
will move by tomorrow.

00:11:58.620 --> 00:12:00.600
That is what I mean.

00:12:00.600 --> 00:12:02.290
As you wish.

00:12:03.310 --> 00:12:04.500
Yes.

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:06.130
I will sit back and observe.

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:09.580
Until the time comes.

00:12:14.890 --> 00:12:16.250
<i>What is he doing?</i>

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:21.260
<i>Chi, chi, chi?</i>

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:24.760
<i>What is he doing?</i>

00:12:26.080 --> 00:12:28.010
<i>What are those movements?</i>

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:30.770
<i>I can't even fathom what 
that's supposed to be!</i>

00:12:32.720 --> 00:12:34.020
<i>A cat toy?!</i>

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:36.150
<i>That's it, I got it!</i>

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:38.020
<i>He's playing air-cat!</i>

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:41.920
<i>I can see it. I can see it!</i>

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:43.530
<i>There's no mistaking it.</i>

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:45.910
<i>This guy is flirting with a cat!</i>

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:48.280
<i>He's materialized a 
cat inside his mind,</i>

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:50.660
<i>and now he's acting 
like it's really there!</i>

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:53.160
Why would you even do that?!

00:12:54.970 --> 00:12:56.850
I'm very sorry about that.

00:12:56.850 --> 00:12:59.670
I haven't had enough 
cat particles lately.

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:02.170
<i>How are you supposed to 
get those through that?!</i>

00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:07.440
By the way, would you mind telling 
me a little bit about Lord Nabokov?

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:10.370
Like, how they view him in his domain 
and what his temperament is like.

00:13:10.370 --> 00:13:12.770
Are you also opposed to the union?

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:13.680
Also?

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:16.750
I had the opportunity 
to have a little chat

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:19.170
with one of your retinue.

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:20.240
That would be Kon.

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:23.690
I do sense that you are worried.

00:13:25.790 --> 00:13:27.570
I am a knight.

00:13:27.850 --> 00:13:29.520
I do not presume to have an opinion

00:13:29.520 --> 00:13:32.030
once my master has made 
up her mind to act.

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:34.940
When it comes to her, though,

00:13:34.940 --> 00:13:37.580
she is not only my master, 
she is also my daughter.

00:13:38.270 --> 00:13:41.090
An irreplaceable and precious daughter.

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:42.530
Is that so?

00:13:42.530 --> 00:13:44.090
<i>What's gotten into these guys?</i>

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:45.480
If nothing else...

00:13:46.140 --> 00:13:49.840
If nothing else, let's hope 
Lord Nabokov is a cat lover!

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:51.810
<i>How far can your cat obsession go?</i>

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:56.060
I-Is something wrong?

00:13:56.060 --> 00:14:00.040
You know, I feel like I've 
met you before somewhere.

00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:01.070
<i>Not again...</i>

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:03.980
I'd know that special nose anywhere!

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:05.450
I'll say it again, it's not the nose!

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:13.530
Sheesh.

00:14:24.750 --> 00:14:26.180
Excuse me.

00:14:27.270 --> 00:14:28.180
Yes?

00:14:28.790 --> 00:14:30.640
Are you also opposed to the marriage?

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:31.460
What?

00:14:31.460 --> 00:14:32.850
Your companions all seem to be.

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:34.460
Kon, huh?

00:14:34.460 --> 00:14:36.350
Couldn't keep his mouth shut again.

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:37.900
Don't worry.

00:14:37.900 --> 00:14:40.140
I may not look it, but your 
secret is safe with me.

00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:41.860
Why, thank you very much!

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:43.700
Not at all.

00:14:43.700 --> 00:14:45.480
On the contrary, 
I seem to have imposed.

00:14:46.710 --> 00:14:50.160
It's natural to wish happiness 
to those you care about.

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.490
Don't you think?

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:53.370
That is true, yes.

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:58.410
Sometimes, I wonder if we can 
really comprehend how

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:01.100
people who have been born with 
a destiny have to suffer.

00:15:01.100 --> 00:15:01.500
Um...

00:15:01.680 --> 00:15:04.360
Sometimes, love is a truly brutal thing,

00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:06.950
and yet that's why people fall in love!

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:08.010
Anyone home?

00:15:08.790 --> 00:15:10.730
There are people who laugh 
while they are angry.

00:15:10.730 --> 00:15:13.270
There are people who cry 
while telling dirty jokes.

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:16.410
Thinking about it, there are even 
those people who are capable

00:15:16.410 --> 00:15:18.270
of being sound asleep with 
their eyes wide open.

00:15:18.470 --> 00:15:21.810
Exactly, people just 
can't be easily judged!

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:25.400
<i>I really have zero clue as to 
what you're babbling about!</i>

00:15:26.970 --> 00:15:29.330
Hey, you know, that nose...

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:30.960
How many times do I have to tell you?

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:35.620
It's not the nose!

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:39.620
I didn't even say nose.

00:15:41.380 --> 00:15:44.380
This is starting to get ridiculous.

00:15:44.760 --> 00:15:46.270
They're dead, so who cares?

00:15:46.270 --> 00:15:48.130
Last but not least.

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:53.540
Have you come to kill me?

00:15:53.540 --> 00:15:54.990
You're a clever one!

00:15:54.990 --> 00:15:56.350
How did you know?

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:57.340
You didn't knock.

00:15:57.340 --> 00:15:58.140
You're wearing a mustache disguise.

00:15:58.140 --> 00:15:59.890
Your uniform is ill-fitting.

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:01.140
Shall I go on?

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:04.150
This was some useless junk.

00:16:06.640 --> 00:16:08.160
I've seen you before.

00:16:08.160 --> 00:16:10.030
You're one of Erecpyle's stooges.

00:16:10.030 --> 00:16:11.530
My name's Variation and 
if you're wondering

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:15.030
if I'm a sadist or a masochist, 
I am a raging sadist.

00:16:17.020 --> 00:16:18.250
What's wrong?

00:16:18.250 --> 00:16:19.540
Aren't you going to kill me?

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:24.040
I will, but I thought we 
could talk a little first.

00:16:25.050 --> 00:16:27.300
Did you learn how to kill 
people in a cheap thriller?

00:16:27.780 --> 00:16:31.300
They always do stuff like that 
and then miss their big chance.

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:32.840
Don't worry.

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:35.440
I already took care of 
all your underlings.

00:16:35.440 --> 00:16:36.910
That is to say, 
nobody will come save you.

00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:41.320
Seeing you in person like this, 
I have to say, you really are a brat.

00:16:41.320 --> 00:16:42.250
Leave me alone.

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:45.310
A brat like this is sacrificing 
herself for the world, huh?

00:16:45.710 --> 00:16:48.130
The next time you call me a brat,

00:16:48.130 --> 00:16:51.320
I will cut off your head. 
I'm not bluffing.

00:16:51.660 --> 00:16:54.430
That's so cute. I'm shaking in my boots.

00:16:54.430 --> 00:16:59.230
Bullying children isn't my thing, so if 
you listen to me, I'll make it quick.

00:16:59.750 --> 00:17:02.630
So answer my question properly.

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:04.320
You will, right, sweetheart?

00:17:20.190 --> 00:17:23.540
I guess my decision to hide dirty 
magazines in my shirt saved my life.

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:25.160
Was that lucky or...

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:27.020
<i>Princess...</i>

00:17:28.320 --> 00:17:29.520
Princess!

00:17:32.050 --> 00:17:32.900
Geezer!

00:17:38.150 --> 00:17:39.500
What the...

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:41.560
It looks like my random 
decision to put

00:17:41.560 --> 00:17:43.790
a gold coin in my chest 
pocket saved my life.

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:44.590
We have to hurry.

00:17:44.590 --> 00:17:45.530
The princess is in danger!

00:17:51.200 --> 00:17:51.870
Sis!

00:17:51.870 --> 00:17:52.960
Mariandel!

00:17:58.570 --> 00:18:01.720
Looks like the iron padding I randomly 
put in my bra saved my life!

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:03.220
Why is it iron?

00:18:06.430 --> 00:18:08.170
Looks like the sheriff's badge

00:18:08.180 --> 00:18:10.790
I randomly put under my hide saved it!

00:18:14.770 --> 00:18:15.980
Princess!

00:18:17.140 --> 00:18:18.130
It's locked!

00:18:18.130 --> 00:18:19.010
Step back!

00:18:21.870 --> 00:18:22.630
Princess!

00:18:22.630 --> 00:18:23.330
Princess!

00:18:25.240 --> 00:18:26.250
Princess!

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:31.470
Princess...

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:36.270
Hey, Princess!

00:18:41.520 --> 00:18:42.760
Princess!

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:46.270
Princess!

00:18:47.420 --> 00:18:48.920
Shut up, you guys.

00:18:48.920 --> 00:18:50.020
I was trying to sleep.

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:51.520
Princess!

00:18:51.910 --> 00:18:55.530
It is unforgivable that this 
occurred while we were here.

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:58.030
You're safe.

00:19:03.270 --> 00:19:05.730
How did this happen?

00:19:05.730 --> 00:19:07.940
How did all of them survive?

00:19:09.050 --> 00:19:12.040
I guess I shouldn't be surprised 
by their toughness by now.

00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:16.370
But wait, didn't he come 
to kill you, Princess?

00:19:16.700 --> 00:19:18.050
Looks like it.

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:21.050
So you should have been 
dead, by all accounts.

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:22.550
How did you survive?

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:24.290
I wonder...

00:19:24.940 --> 00:19:26.190
If I had to guess,

00:19:26.190 --> 00:19:28.280
I'd say it's because I played 
through a cheap thriller with him.

00:19:30.370 --> 00:19:33.030
Why did you agree to get 
married this young?

00:19:33.370 --> 00:19:35.740
You could have refused.

00:19:35.740 --> 00:19:38.220
Can you tell me the weight of my life?

00:19:38.220 --> 00:19:39.750
The weight of your life?

00:19:39.750 --> 00:19:41.450
I simply put it on a scale.

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:45.300
If I agreed to the marriage, we could 
avoid war for quite some time.

00:19:45.820 --> 00:19:48.380
When I think about the weight of 
all the lives that could be saved,

00:19:48.380 --> 00:19:50.960
sacrificing my life does 
not seem like much.

00:19:51.270 --> 00:19:54.520
And then, it's not like marriage 
is synonymous with death.

00:19:54.520 --> 00:19:59.240
Yes, but now because of that, 
we are here to take your life.

00:19:59.240 --> 00:20:00.550
It doesn't matter.

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:03.470
Even if you kill me, there are any 
number who could take my place.

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:07.220
Looking at it another way, 
it's not as if there is a

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:10.370
guarantee that we can avoid 
war if I get married.

00:20:10.990 --> 00:20:12.220
You're right.

00:20:12.720 --> 00:20:13.960
Then let me ask.

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:16.020
Why are you getting married 
despite all that?

00:20:16.410 --> 00:20:18.230
A human sacrifice is needed.

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:21.240
You sure are farsighted, for a kid.

00:20:21.560 --> 00:20:22.760
That's not true.

00:20:22.760 --> 00:20:25.240
That's just my official, 
diplomatic answer.

00:20:26.400 --> 00:20:27.990
So what are your individual reasons?

00:20:28.810 --> 00:20:31.500
I can't untangle it so easily.

00:20:32.070 --> 00:20:34.440
Honestly, there are times 
when I want to run away.

00:20:34.440 --> 00:20:36.360
Are you really a little kid?

00:20:36.800 --> 00:20:39.300
Would it have been easier 
if I had played dumb?

00:20:39.760 --> 00:20:42.260
The end result is the same.

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:44.640
I see. Then hurry up and do it.

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:47.640
This isn't fair to my companions.

00:20:49.170 --> 00:20:52.140
If I'm completely honest, 
I'm a little relieved.

00:20:56.040 --> 00:20:57.080
I quit.

00:20:57.640 --> 00:20:59.610
You see, I'm a massive sadist.

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:02.650
Which means I'm not into doing things 
that would make someone happy.

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:06.660
I'll lend you a life, but, 
I'll want it back someday.

00:21:07.960 --> 00:21:09.280
I don't remember borrowing it.

00:21:13.610 --> 00:21:16.540
I don't really get what you mean

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:18.040
when you say that.

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:20.110
Princess?

00:21:22.410 --> 00:21:24.430
You owe me, you stupid brat.

00:21:27.440 --> 00:21:32.710
Hey, Princess. Tell us! 
What happened? Princess!

00:21:36.180 --> 00:21:37.250
That's...

00:21:37.250 --> 00:21:39.270
Yes, Jugglaburk.

00:21:39.710 --> 00:21:41.780
We've finally made it.

00:21:42.510 --> 00:21:45.280
<i>I guess that means our journey is over.</i>

00:21:45.830 --> 00:21:48.560
So what's going to happen to us now?

00:21:48.970 --> 00:21:50.330
What do you mean?

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:52.390
I mean once the princess gets married.

00:21:52.770 --> 00:21:55.290
I guess she's fine because 
she'll take care of the princess,

00:21:55.290 --> 00:21:58.830
but won't it be bad for 
you to be in this country?

00:21:58.830 --> 00:22:00.960
Just from a Warring States 
Period kind of perspective.

00:22:01.270 --> 00:22:02.960
You might be right.

00:22:03.270 --> 00:22:06.190
I knew it. That means we're...

00:22:06.190 --> 00:22:08.610
You'll be relieved from your 
duty eventually. However...

00:22:10.040 --> 00:22:12.280
The wedding won't take 
place for a while.

00:22:12.280 --> 00:22:15.270
We still have about one month to go.

00:22:15.270 --> 00:22:16.820
Until then, the princess

00:22:16.820 --> 00:22:20.730
needs to go through eighteen 
rituals before the wedding.

00:22:21.100 --> 00:22:22.270
I see.

00:22:22.890 --> 00:22:24.490
That's right.

00:22:24.990 --> 00:22:27.020
I'll make sure to squeeze 
you hard until then,

00:22:27.020 --> 00:22:29.490
so stop worrying, servant.

00:22:30.740 --> 00:22:31.910
Keep talking.

00:24:09.960 --> 00:24:24.810
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:10.970 --> 00:24:13.350
After we've made it to 
Jugglaburk's capital,

00:24:13.350 --> 00:24:15.770
we start to prepare for the 
princess's wedding ritual.

00:24:15.770 --> 00:24:19.060
What? That Ixion Experimentation Lab...

00:24:19.060 --> 00:24:22.650
Couldn't I find out how 
to get to Olvidia there?!

00:24:24.810 --> 00:24:30.820
What is Alma? What is Olvidia?

00:24:24.810 --> 00:24:30.820
And what's a Hyperion?

00:24:30.820 --> 00:24:34.530
Nobody has explained it so far,

00:24:30.820 --> 00:24:34.530
but finally there's someone who might.
